# Frictional mortar contact is a non-smooth complementarity problem, so the exact
# number of Newton/linear iterations needed to reach convergence is sensitive to
# platform-specific floating-point rounding, even though the converged nodal
# solution (checked below) is unaffected. Widen the solver-iteration-count
# postprocessors accordingly, following the precedent set for the analogous
# num_nl/cumulative postprocessors in
# contact/test/tests/3d-mortar-contact/frictionless-mortar-3d.cmp.

ELEMENT VARIABLES (all)

NODAL VARIABLES (all)

GLOBAL VARIABLES (all)
	num_lin_it       relative 3e-1
	num_nonlin_it    relative 3e-1
	tot_lin_it       relative 3e-1
	tot_nonlin_it    relative 3e-1
